# Cloudflare Workers / Pages redirect rules
# SPA fallback is handled by the Worker (single-page-application). These rules run before fallback.
# Workers.dev -> canonical domain (requires Cloudflare dashboard Bulk Redirect for true 301; JS fallback in index.html handles client-side)
# Legacy /app/* paths are also handled client-side via React Router <Navigate>; these edge redirects provide 301 for crawlers.
# Uncomment if your platform respects _redirects for host-level redirects:

/app/planner  /planner  301
/app/mentor  /mentor  301
/app/backlog  /backlogs  301
/app/recovery  /recovery  301
/app/subjects  /subjects  301
/app/formulas  /vault  301
/app/timer  /timer  301
/app/analytics  /analytics  301
/app/settings  /settings  301
/app/preferences  /preferences  301
/app  /dashboard  301
